### ==============================================================================
### Civic Issue Heatmap - API Request Examples (.http / REST Client Format)
### Base URL: http://localhost:8080
### ==============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@authToken = {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 1. Actuator Endpoints
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health
Accept: application/json

### Application Info
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/info
Accept: application/json

### Application Metrics
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/metrics
Accept: application/json


### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 2. Authentication Flow
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Register New Citizen Account
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Jane Citizen",
  "email": "jane.citizen@example.com",
  "password": "Password@123",
  "phone": "+1-555-0199"
}

### Citizen Login
# @name loginCitizen
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "jane.citizen@example.com",
  "password": "Password@123"
}

### Admin / Default Seeded Login
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@civicheat.gov",
  "password": "Admin@123"
}

### Get Current User Profile (Me)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}
Accept: application/json


### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 3. Department Management
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### List All Active Municipal Departments
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/departments
Accept: application/json

### Get Department Complaints (Filtered)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/departments/a31ad8c2-8da7-4a21-b649-ddef0a9e4ebb/complaints?page=0&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}
Accept: application/json


### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 4. Complaint Reporting & Lifecycle
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Submit a New Civic Complaint (Multipart JSON + Image)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/complaints
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCitizen.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="complaint"; filename="complaint.json"
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Hazardous Deep Pothole on Market Street",
  "description": "Deep dangerous pothole near the intersection of 4th and Market Street causing severe traffic slowdown and hazard to bicycles.",
  "category": "POTHOLE",
  "latitude": 37.7749,
  "longitude": -122.4194,
  "address": "Market St & 4th St, San Francisco, CA"
}
--WebAppBoundary--

### Submit Duplicate Complaint (Triggers Duplicate Detector)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/complaints
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCitizen.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="complaint"; filename="complaint.json"
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Hazardous Deep Pothole on Market Street",
  "description": "Deep dangerous pothole near the intersection of 4th and Market Street causing severe traffic slowdown and hazard to bicycles.",
  "category": "POTHOLE",
  "latitude": 37.7750,
  "longitude": -122.4195,
  "address": "4th & Market St"
}
--WebAppBoundary--

### Get Complaint Details by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/complaints/6dc5f0ee-2b3d-47f6-9723-e27aee09baa6
Accept: application/json

### Upvote a Complaint
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/complaints/6dc5f0ee-2b3d-47f6-9723-e27aee09baa6/upvote
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCitizen.response.body.token}}
Accept: application/json

### Query Paginated Complaints with Multi-Filter
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/complaints?category=POTHOLE&status=ASSIGNED&page=0&size=20&sort=createdAt,desc
Accept: application/json

### Get Logged-in Citizen's Own Complaints
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/complaints/mine?page=0&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCitizen.response.body.token}}
Accept: application/json


### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 5. Heatmap & Spatial Analytics
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Lightweight Heatmap Points (for Leaflet.heat)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/heatmap/points?category=POTHOLE&days=30
Accept: application/json

### Ranked Hotspot Clusters (Grid Clustering)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/heatmap/hotspots?cellSize=250&minCount=2
Accept: application/json

### Overall System Analytics & KPIs
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/heatmap/stats
Accept: application/json


### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 6. Administrative & Officer Operations
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Update Complaint Status (Officer / Admin)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/complaints/6dc5f0ee-2b3d-47f6-9723-e27aee09baa6/status
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "IN_PROGRESS",
  "remark": "Field dispatch team assigned and en route with repair asphalt."
}

### Mark Complaint Resolved
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/complaints/6dc5f0ee-2b3d-47f6-9723-e27aee09baa6/status
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "RESOLVED",
  "remark": "Pothole successfully filled and compacted with hot mix asphalt."
}

### Provision New Department Officer Account (Admin Only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/officers
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Officer Robert Vance",
  "email": "robert.vance@civicheat.gov",
  "password": "Officer@12345",
  "phone": "+1-555-0144",
  "departmentId": "a31ad8c2-8da7-4a21-b649-ddef0a9e4ebb"
}

### Reassign Complaint to Another Department (Admin Only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/complaints/6dc5f0ee-2b3d-47f6-9723-e27aee09baa6/reassign
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "departmentId": "ca5a1919-5c86-4b4f-87a6-3eb99c695035",
  "reason": "Debris and garbage obstruction rather than structural pavement failure."
}
